trackedfeedback ## 2026-10-07 · codex · mylang — S4-V value paths

- good: Whole-tree `guardian-check all . --gate` ran all 88 checks for nested COW, CFG inlining and numeric buffer formatting; cognitive-complexity caught a 28-point CFG splicer and spec coverage caught duplicate/missing tags before the final green source commits.
- bug: A selected Zig unit test panicked on a null lookup and terminated with SIGABRT, yet Guardian's test runner printed `PASS — 0 passed` and `RESULT {"passed":0,"failed":0,"skipped":0}`. Zig's enclosing build summary correctly reported one crashed test and returned status 1; consumers of RESULT alone would miss the crash. Reproduction was `zig build test-core -Dtest-filter=uniform --summary all` with a fixture whose uncalled function had been pruned.


